# SPA fallback for client routes (e.g. /play, /share?p=…). /api/* and /packs/*
# are handled by Pages Functions first. Cloudflare does not support 404 *rewrites*
# here; missing packs are 404 via functions/packs/[[path]].ts so Workbox cannot
# cache index.html as pack JSON.
#
# Pages Functions skip _redirects. Keep public/_routes.json include limited to
# /api/* and /packs/* so client routes hit this SPA rewrite.
# Do NOT ship a top-level 404.html — Pages then serves that file with 404 and
# disables this SPA fallback (Serving Pages).
/*    /index.html   200
